NOTICE

This repository is a fan port of "Adventure Time: Card Wars", a mobile game
originally developed by Kung Fu Factory and published under license from
Cartoon Network Studios. The game was delisted from app stores and is no
longer commercially available.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
Cartoon Network Studios, Warner Bros. Discovery, Kung Fu Factory, or any
related entity. All trademarks, characters, artwork, audio, animations, and
other game assets remain the property of their respective owners.

The MIT license above applies only to original code contributions made in
this fork. It does not, and cannot, grant any rights over the underlying
intellectual property of "Adventure Time" or "Card Wars", which is owned by
the original rights holders.

This project is distributed for non-commercial, archival, and educational
purposes. If you are a rights holder and wish for this project to be removed,
please open an issue or contact the maintainer; takedown requests will be
honored.
